      "message": "we can return from u2f_try_load_state() with false if getvar(\u0026k_salt) succeeded but a later read_tpm_nvmem_hidden() failed. in this case state-\u003esalt is set from getvar(\u0026k_salt), but u2f_generate_state_keys() overwrites it with random value.\nthat\u0027s a change in behavior compared to before.\n\nwe can migrate from cr50 that has only NVMEM_VAR_G2F_SALT to this cr50 version. in this case we shall get the salt from NVMEM_VAR_G2F_SALT and continue with it to preserve keyhandles.",
